 Most of the evaluation, file assembly and criticality validation 2631 1451
 was performed at BNL and IAEA. Authors of the evaluation are:    2631 1451
                                                                  2631 1451
 M. Herman, A. Trkov, R. Capote, G.P.A. Nobre, D.A. Brown,        2631 1451
                      R. Arcilla,                                 2631 1451
                           and                                    2631 1451
 Y. Danon, A. Plompen, Q. Jing, G. Zhigang, L. Tingjin,           2631 1451
 L. Hanlin, R. Xichao, L. Leal,  B.V. Carlson, T. Kawano,         2631 1451
