              EMPIRE options                                      2631 1451
              --------------                                      2631 1451
                                                                  2631 1451
 Following options and deviations from the default values of the  2631 1451
 parameters were employed in the EMPIRE calculations:             2631 1451
                                                                  2631 1451
 - CC calculations using soft-rotor omp for the incident channel. 2631 1451
   Total cross section was scaled by factor increasing from 0.780 2631 1451
   at 1 keV  to 1.0 at 4 MeV.                                     2631 1451
 - CN decay and Direct cross sections added incoherently.         2631 1451
 - Traditional Hauser-Feschbach Tlj_{CC}(E)=Tlj_{GS}(E-Egs).      2631 1451
 - HRTW width fluctuation correction calculated  up to 12.10 MeV. 2631 1451
 - Tlj coupling for the top CN bin  up to incident  9.90 MeV.     2631 1451
 - CN anisotropy calculated using Blatt-Biedenharn coefficients.  2631 1451
 - Coupled Channels Method used for Tl calcul. in outgoing ch.    2631 1451
 - Discrete levels were taken from the RIPL-3+                    2631 1451
    library based on the 2015 version of ENSDF.                   2631 1451
 - Gamma-transition multipolarity set to 2.                       2631 1451
 - GDR parameters taken from RIPL/Exp.data+Plujko systematics.    2631 1451
 - E1 strength function set to RIPL MLO1 except 56Fe in which it  2631 1451
    was set to Weisskopf estimate scaled by factor of 0.1         2631 1451
    instead of the default (0.01).                                2631 1451
 - Gilbert-Cameron (EMPIRE 2.18) level densities.                 2631 1451
 - Preequilibrium mechanism treated in terms of the exciton model 2631 1451
    with the Iwamoto-Harada model for emission of clusters, and   2631 1451
    Kalbach systematics angular distributions (see RIPL-1)        2631 1451
                                                                  2631 1451
 Mean free path parameter in PCROSS set to  1.9 (default:~1.5)    2631 1451
